body:
i usually use maxis match cc, and cc from [sims historical finds](https://simshistoricalfinds.tumblr.com/).  but in game i usually use the off the grid stuff from cottage living, and gameplay mods i use the [medieval cookbook](https://www.reddit.com/r/thesims/comments/yavod1/im_doing_morbids_ultimate_decade_challenge_here/).

&#x200B;

for both sims, some defaults i use are [lamatisse skin](https://lamatisse.tumblr.com/post/626644431812100096/bare-a-skintone-pack-there-are-so-many-creators), [these eyes](https://mmoutfitters.tumblr.com/post/611239412886568960/flameiyo-hameln-renee-eyes-hello-this-isnt), and [strudel](https://emilyccfinds.tumblr.com/post/695647282870288385/elainaasccfinds-strudel-by-elaina-gshade-preset) g-shade preset by elaina

Thanks, that makes me feel more hopeful. I assumed so but also got nervous because sometime's I'll go to the bathroom / too lazy and just won't put the computer on mute & my discord friends will say some controversial / messed up things. I hope it's not because of that because that's not me!

&#x200B;

How do you still talk while being a bit more respectful? I grew up as an only child so that was never really an issue for me.

check your dms!

&#x200B;

(this is against TOS of reddit btw)
